{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts in Oxford","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"In Oxford:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"9.6","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Oxford was above the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"56%","note":"","content":"<p>In Berkshire, Buckinghamshire and Oxfordshire, an average proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"59%","note":"","content":"<p>An average proportion of health and social care job adverts in Berkshire, Buckinghamshire and Oxfordshire could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were more online job adverts than the UK average in Oxford","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Oxford rose to 9.5 per 100 working-age residents (aged 16 to 64 years), from 7.8 adverts in August 2023. </p><p>This was higher than the UK average of 3.4 adverts per 100 working-age residents in August 2024. </p>"},{"id":"linechart","type":"Chart","chartType":"line","title":"Trends in job adverts","subtitle":"Trends in job adverts per 100 working-age residents in Oxford, June 2017 to August 2024","footer":"Source: Textkernel, Office for National Statistics","data":[{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":6.840141958},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":7.279054305},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":7.494020327},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":7.260230207},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":6.755433516},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":6.729831015},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":6.672193007},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":7.186611339},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":7.264577266},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":7.292498948},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":8.26447417},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-04-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":8.233674407},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":8.444375714},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":8.600221655},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":8.225083121},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":7.991614904},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":8.238614397},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":7.967129737},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2018-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":7.048978926},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":6.985829663},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2019-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":7.591990829},{"z":"Oxford","x":"2019-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","